            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-24T10:00:50.051405+00:00",
            "notes": "From here on out, there are a *bunch* of really good items to take for your build in the last two slots, so here's a wall of text going over them:\n- [Champion's Kit](item_8682f8c7-8811-439b-8d50-fa81cd43ddce): The pure damage option. If you'd rather just a bunch of ability power, this is your best option. \n- [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98): More useful than you might think, especially in making it easier to hit shots, and making it harder for them to run away. \n- [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e): Second best amount of AP gain, and the added CDR is nice. \n- [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505): A very good item. I'd recommend taking this if someone on your team doesn't already have it or [El-sa'ka Supressor](item_b4298dd9-9b93-461f-a2e0-843402667100). \n- [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4): More ults more often! Considering how with AP BOB hits like a truck, this is a good option. \n- [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8): With two uses of coach gun, even with longer cooldowns on Ashe's abilities this item is pretty good, especially if you're worried about survivability.\n- [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6): The \"I don't have enough for an epic item\" option.",
