            "created_at": "2025-08-24T10:00:50.051405+00:00",
            "notes": "Now, a bunch of powers!\n- [Reload Therapy](item_1d85105f-1ec7-4ec7-a56d-f273c09f4b3e): 10% of your hp is not a small amount. Especially good so your supports don't have to babysit you if you're at a weird angle. [Greased Loader](item_0ee48089-49a3-4980-a6f6-3d4b72585ead) can help with this, but IMO isn't as worth to take in most games at round 7. \n- [My Business, My Rules](item_0dac0a70-77f1-4560-8a4d-16304c022552): This counts if all you're doing is going for non-scope shots. If you wanna go all out, pair this with [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) or maybe even [Greased Loader](item_0ee48089-49a3-4980-a6f6-3d4b72585ead) and it'd probably be fun. \n- [B.O.B Jr.](item_a0599423-2cd6-4779-81c1-fb933fbad07d): Personally, I prefer big BOB that does even more damage, but if you want your ult up often this is a good pick. Pair it with [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) and [Catalytic Crystal](item_3e3f4f77-cdf8-4dda-a5b0-2fb9390aefc4) and you'll get him even *more*. \n- [Out with a Bang](item_0c3398a1-34aa-48d0-81c1-0e4f1cf4f739): This just makes you more annoying for the enemy to deal with. What I see a lot of AP Ashes get early, and it's not bad late game either.\n\nSame things apply with the items as last round, but this time one more slot. You *can* keep [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) if you want, but I'd usually go for epic items instead of it if you have the cash.",
